<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ar" dir="rtl">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>موقع القرآن الكريم والمحاضرات</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri:wght@700&family=Cairo:wght@400;600;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-gradient: linear-gradient(135deg, #071810 0%, #0f3822 50%, #164e31 100%);
            --box-bg: rgba(15, 56, 34, 0.85);
            --gold: #f3e5ab;
            --gold-bright: #ffd700;
            --border-gold: rgba(243, 229, 171, 0.45);
            --text-light: #ffffff;
            --text-muted: #c2d0c5;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Cairo', sans-serif;
            background: var(--bg-gradient);
            margin: 0;
            padding: 15px;
            color: var(--text-light);
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .main-header {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f3822 0%, #1b5e3a 100%);
            color: var(--gold);
            padding: 30px 15px;
            border-radius: 22px;
            text-align: center;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6), inset 0 0 20px rgba(243, 229, 171, 0.15);
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            border: 2px solid var(--gold);
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 550px;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            position: relative;
        }

        .main-header h1 {
            font-family: 'Amiri', serif;
            font-size: 32px;
            margin: 0 0 8px 0;
            text-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
            color: var(--gold-bright);
        }

        .main-header p {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 14px;
            margin: 0;
        }

        .grid-container {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 550px;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 12px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .nav-card {
            background: var(--box-bg);
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            padding: 18px 12px;
            border-radius: 16px;
            box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-gold);
            text-decoration: none;
            color: var(--text-light);
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            text-align: center;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        .nav-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-3px);
            border-color: var(--gold-bright);
            box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.3);
            background: rgba(22, 78, 49, 0.95);
        }

        .nav-icon {
            font-size: 26px;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            background: rgba(243, 229, 171, 0.12);
            padding: 10px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(243, 229, 171, 0.25);
        }

        .nav-title {
            font-family: 'Amiri', serif;
            font-size: 20px;
            color: var(--gold);
            margin: 0;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        .full-width-box {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 550px;
            background: var(--box-bg);
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 18px;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 25px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-gold);
            box-sizing: border-box;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .full-width-box h3 {
            font-family: 'Amiri', serif;
            color: var(--gold);
            font-size: 22px;
            margin-top: 0;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .sub-card {
            background: #113f27;
            padding: 14px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            border: 1px solid var(--border-gold);
            color: var(--text-light);
            font-family: 'Amiri', serif;
            font-size: 18px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 8px;
            box-shadow: inset 0 0 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
        }

        .footer-note {
            margin-top: 25px;
            font-size: 11px;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            text-align: center;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="main-header">
        <h1>موقع القرآن الكريم والمحاضرات</h1>
        <p>منصة مباركة لخدمة العلوم الشرعية</p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid-container">
        <!-- المقالات -->
        <a href="#" class="nav-card">
            <div class="nav-icon">📝</div>
            <h2 class="nav-title">المقالات</h2>
        </a>

        <!-- الصوتيات -->
        <a href="#" class="nav-card">
            <div class="nav-icon">🎧</div>
            <h2 class="nav-title">الصوتيات</h2>
        </a>

        <!-- الفتاوى -->
        <a href="#" class="nav-card">
            <div class="nav-icon">💡</div>
            <h2 class="nav-title">الفتاوى</h2>
        </a>

        <!-- الكتب والرسائل -->
        <a href="/books" class="nav-card">
            <div class="nav-icon">📚</div>
            <h2 class="nav-title">الكتب والرسائل</h2>
        </a>
    </div>

    <div class="full-width-box">
        <h3>آخر الصوتيات والمحاضرات</h3>
        <div class="sub-card">
            <span>🔊</span>
            <span>سورة الفاتحة</span>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="footer-note">
        جميع الحقوق محفوظة © 2026
    </div>

</body>
</html>
